{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1640995200, "end_date": 1641686399, "month_true_total": 1652, "quota": 16, "returned": 16, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:48:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "107629804", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979758022", "personaname": "D0nk3yPunch3r *DO WORK*", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ESKIMOJOJO/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 32807, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9566, "last_played": 1777206327, "avatar": "ac8cdd885f08ad96679503c2984f9cb84e373215"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have tried to like it, I have tried to be open minded but I just cant. \n\nquickplay w/crossplay- Cancer, Don't do it. Ever, EVER. \nI mean you may get a lobby with ok team but more often than not, you'll wish you hadn't.\n\nquickplay wo/crossplay- More often than not, join lobby with no communication and has at least 1 speed runner going off to \"clear the way\" but we all know what that means..\n\nweapons- the ump does the same dmg as ak47? \n\nattachments- Can only take them off by swapping with another. See one you want on a weapon you dont? too bad no swapping on the fly.\n\nmelee- It works\n\nSpecials- Special projectiles are so bad it feels like hit scan, Imagine the spitter from l4d but pre aplha\n\nmissions- They figured out how to make an inch feel like a mile. That being said on nightmare your either gonna just run or turtle your way through. it's not fluid at all.\n\nA huge BUT with friends how ever this game is fun. but overall not worth it, I'll re-evaluate my opinion after some more updates.\n\nyou want to play Left 4 dead? just play left 4 dead", "timestamp_created": 1641686140, "timestamp_updated": 1641686140, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519230782985687256", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107629792", "author": {"steamid": "76561198151184218", "personaname": "Leaf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198151184218/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1061, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1061, "last_played": 1635648385, "avatar": "8a78a24d3ae3031caf2695bc4dede2d6eb7af7cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you're looking for Left 4 Dead 3 you will not find it in this game. The lack of polish and attention to the important details that made Left 4 Dead 1 and 2 staples in the history of the genre and gaming is apparent everywhere you look in Back 4 Blood. There's very little to enjoy about this game that will last longer than a single playthrough. If Left 4 Dead 2 is a 10/10, this gets a 5/10 from me. They missed the mark and dared to charge $60 for a worse version of the game they directly compare themselves to.", "timestamp_created": 1641686124, "timestamp_updated": 1641686124, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107629497", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059939816", "personaname": "Radio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RadioDaW0lf/", "num_games_owned": 414, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 648, "last_played": 1644796880, "avatar": "97547d613dddb89419f0ef110ec2b704e92020cc"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was exited for B4B to come out and wasnt too thrilled with the beta, the limited campaign \"retries\" are annoying and discouraging to want to continue. When it comes to gun mods, players are greedy and give you their scraps if you are not quick to get to it. Special infected are L4D knock offs. There is no character development. And the game feels to grindy for little reward.\n\nTL:DR\nDont buy this game at full price, wait for sale.\nWant a good game and good story? Play L4D/L4D2", "timestamp_created": 1641685747, "timestamp_updated": 1641685747, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481927722692489624", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107628714", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052211566", "personaname": "刘宇辰何清然张君威", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052211566/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 655, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 644, "last_played": 1660861711, "avatar": "06a65cccb0e12a7ef1b2e2031afec8ccd04dffb7"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you put decorations around a ♥♥♥♥ and make it look good. It's still just gonna be ♥♥♥♥, That's Back 4 Blood", "timestamp_created": 1641684863, "timestamp_updated": 1641684863, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50619196891784668", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107626897", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025521783", "personaname": "nightrunner84", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025521783/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 79885, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6963, "last_played": 1740353043, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This really is the worst game I've ever played. Why can't it be like L4D? Too complicated, stupid card system, and bullet sponge enemies. They spawn two or three at a time, you can't kill them except with multiple mags, even on easy. Then, it starts you all over again at the beginning. \n\nThis was really easy, make another L4D, How do you screw that up?", "timestamp_created": 1641682863, "timestamp_updated": 1641682863, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107626876", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998649149", "personaname": "JustWill", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197998649149/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 374, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 374, "last_played": 1636266938, "avatar": "a8d69bc62bbcd0cafd62a98fb5eefc589b254c78"}, "language": "english", "review": "TL;DR: Meh, boring.\n\nWatered down version of L4D2 with better graphics, and small new gimmicks like deck building (I love deck building in general, but not this one.)\nOnly through power of friendship you can overcome this boredom.\n\nI would only buy this game if:\n1. My friends really want to play\n2. went on sale for over 50%\n", "timestamp_created": 1641682842, "timestamp_updated": 1641682842, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck":